Z||000007||danny boy||10-11-2001||06:08 PM|||| Sage-I am about 2hrs from Parkersburg.<P>Formula- I'll be here.Come on by.<P>As far as cost goes, they will be very,very cheap. As soon as I can find a good supplier of stainless pipe, I can let everyone know exacts.  <P>Formula again. side out exaust will be very easy, even duals. follow the stock exaust to the 90* bend after the CAT. instead of bending, go straight and down a little. Replace CAT with a Dual in, dual out muffler or two glasspacks and you're there. I do think the stock Fiero exaust is smothering that engine.Its gotta breathe! The Blazer it was in had full length hedders and dual      2 1/2" exaust.||||reg||1
